# Phase E2, VAR: noise at TWO scales in one run, to see whether damage adds up, compounds, or whether
# the earlier corruption is "used up" before the later one. Each stage's noise is exactly the noise of
# the single-stage run at that stage (noise is seeded per image, stage and tensor), so compare with
# Gate B (job 25689627, noise seed 0): pair (a,b) vs single a, single b.
# Pairs: early+late, early+middle, middle+late, near-ends, middle pair; severity 1 and 2 = 10 runs, ~10 min.
#     qsub -P <your-project-id> -l walltime=03:00:00 -v SETTINGS=lanes/p2/jobs/phasee_var_twostage.env lanes/p2/jobs/pilot.pbs
MANIFEST=manifest/frozen_v1_1.csv
EXP_TAG=phasee
QUALITY=1
RUN_VAR=1
RUN_DIT=0
VAR_HOOK=noise_h
VAR_STAGES="0,9 0,5 5,9 1,8 3,6"
SEVERITIES="1.0 2.0"
